From: lunatickochiya <125438787@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:26:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] luci-app-dockerman: add one-click container upgrade

- add an Upgrade action to the container list and detail page
- pull the image tag used by the container, then recreate the container
  with its original configuration (mounts, networks, static IPs, ports,
  environment and resource limits), start it and remove the old instance
- skip the re-creation when the image did not change
- roll back to the previous container when any step fails
- add zh_Hans/zh_Hant translations
